  "text": {
    "intro": "The lighthouses along the Saltmarsh coast share a single relief keeper roster, and the logbooks have become a scholarly mess.\nFour keepers are involved. Determine each keeper's day and lighthouse.\n- **Keeper**: Hollis, Barnaby, Lucian and Clementine.\n- **Day** (listed from earlier to later): Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday.\n- **Lighthouse**: Gannet Rock, Cold Harbour, Mawes Point and Pelter Head.\nEvery keeper has a different day and lighthouse, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "Clementine works on Monday.",
      "The keeper who is stationed at Gannet Rock works on Monday.",
      "The keeper who is stationed at Mawes Point does not work on Thursday.",
      "The keeper who is stationed at Pelter Head is exactly one day earlier than Barnaby, with no day in between.",
      "Lucian is exactly one day earlier than the keeper who is stationed at Cold Harbour, with no day in between."
